00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:23,140
So that's the virtual memory support.

33
00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:33,020
So that we are looking at how to virtually extend the physical memory in order to run a larger process.

34
00:03:33,020 --> 00:03:42,020
So the virtual memory support will involve both the physical memory and the hard disk.

35
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:43,020
